Texas continues to lead the way in chip innovation & advanced manufacturing.
 
@SpaceX & @Tesla’s new semiconductor fabrication facility in Grimes County has the potential to create thousands of jobs for Texans, strengthen America’s semiconductor and AI industry supply chains, & help bring critical chip manufacturing back home. 
 
@SpaceX & @Tesla have also committed to invest millions of dollars in the local community and schools, and I look forward to seeing the benefits to Grimes County grow in the future.

